1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,630
Hi, and welcome to the first lesson of this course,

2
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:06,390
Introduction to the machinery workflow.

3
00:00:06,390 --> 00:00:10,980
Together, we will take the step necessary for any machine learning project,

4
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:14,160
from the problem setup to the model-building phase,

5
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,885
and the error analysis.

6
00:00:15,885 --> 00:00:20,700
This lesson will focus on the high-level component of any machine learning workflow,

7
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,955
